# T114, amended by feature 004 (stories 2 and 3): Update all with four outdated apps asks ONCE: the banner on the first screen says how many updates there
# are, one tap on its button opens the combined confirmation (the four apps with their versions, PB Store last, the facts and the consents about the reader),
# one more tap on Confirm updates all four with no plan page in between, then the summary. (Before feature 004 every app had its own plan and confirmation.)
# scenario updates
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
expect updateNotice 4 updates available
taps_reset
tap updateAllButton
waitfor updateAllIntro
expect updateAllIntro 4 apps
expect_count updateAllEntry 4
expect updateAllEntry 1.2.0 → 1.3.0
expect updateAllFacts The data of your apps is kept
expect updateAllFacts Wi-Fi is switched on only while packages are downloaded
shot @OUT@/31-update-all-confirm.png
tap consent 0
tap consent 1
tap confirm
expect_taps_max 4
# (the progress titles "Updating k of n" pass too quickly for a walk; test_store_controller_operations checks them)
expect_absent planSummary
waitfor resultText Updated:
expect resultText App app-01
expect resultText App app-02
expect resultText App app-03
expect resultText App pbstore
shot @OUT@/32-update-all-summary.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
expect_absent updateBanner
expect_absent updateNotice
quit
